#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:7
msgid ""
"Start a trial or manage your self-hosted deployment by selecting  the "
"**Product** |product-list| menu, selecting **System Console**, and then "
"selecting **About > Edition and License**."
msgstr "**제품** |product-list| 메뉴를 선택하고 **관리자 도구**를 선택한 다음 **정보 > 에디션 및 라이선스**를 선택하여 평가판을 시작하거나 셀프 호스팅 배포를 관리할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:100
msgid ""
"Navigate between Channels, collaborative playbooks, and boards using the "
"product menu icon."
msgstr "제품 메뉴 아이콘을 사용해 채널, 공동 플레이북, 보드 사이를 이동합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:10
msgid "Start a trial"
msgstr "평가판 시작"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:12
msgid ""
"You can start a trial of :ref:`Mattermost Enterprise <product-overview"
"/editions-and-offerings:mattermost enterprise edition>` for free for 30 "
"days. Select **Start trial** and fill out the form to begin."
msgstr ":ref:`Mattermost Enterprise <product-overview/editions-and-offerings:mattermost enterprise edition>` 평가판을 30일 동안 무료로 시작할 수 있습니다. **Start trial**을 선택하고 양식을 작성하여 시작하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:16
msgid ""
"Once you've started a trial, you can't start another one with the same "
"Mattermost instance. If you need more time to evaluate Mattermost "
"Enterprise, contact a `Mattermost Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-"
"sales/>`_."
msgstr "평가판을 한 번 시작하면 동일한 OKR.BEST 인스턴스로 다시 시작할 수 없습니다. Mattermost Enterprise를 평가할 시간이 더 필요하면 `Mattermost Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ 에게 문의하세요."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:19
msgid "Manage your self-hosted deployment"
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포 관리"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:21
msgid ""
"You can also review and manage the following aspects of your self-hosted "
"deployment:"
msgstr "셀프 호스팅 배포의 다음 사항도 검토하고 관리할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:23
msgid ""
"View the :doc:`edition </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>` of "
"your Mattermost self-hosted deployment."
msgstr "OKR.BEST 셀프 호스팅 배포의 :doc:`에디션 </product-overview/editions-and-offerings>`을 확인합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:24
msgid ""
"Manage your :doc:`product subscription </product-overview/self-hosted-"
"subscriptions>`."
msgstr ":doc:`제품 구독 </product-overview/self-hosted-subscriptions>`을 관리합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:25
msgid ""
":doc:`Upload a new license </administration-guide/manage/admin"
"/installing-license-key>`."
msgstr ":doc:`새 라이선스 업로드 </administration-guide/manage/admin/installing-license-key>`."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:26
msgid ""
"Remove a license to :doc:`downgrade the server </administration-"
"guide/upgrade/downgrading-mattermost-server>`."
msgstr "라이선스를 제거하여 :doc:`서버 다운그레이드 </administration-guide/upgrade/downgrading-mattermost-server>`를 수행합니다."

#: ../../source/administration-guide/configure/self-hosted-account-settings.rst:27
msgid ""
"Talk to a `Mattermost Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ "
"for assistance."
msgstr "도움이 필요하면 `Mattermost Expert <https://mattermost.com/contact-sales/>`_ 에게 문의하세요."

